# backend/.dockerignore
#
# Keeps the Docker build context to source only. Mirrors backend/.gitignore
# (venv, __pycache__, local db/secret files) plus Docker/VCS metadata that
# has no reason to enter an image layer. cards.db and .jwt_secret are
# explicitly excluded so a developer's live local database/secret can
# never be baked into an image — the ratified design (ledger row 690)
# requires a fresh named volume, never a copy of live data.
venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
data/
*.db
!samples/*.db
.jwt_secret
.ebisu_secret_key
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
.env
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.pyc
